  "executive_summary": "This is the annual conclusion of AP-2027-001, 2027 Security NFR Controls Testing Plan — Tier 1 \u0026 Tier 2 ICT assets, for 1 Jan – 31 Dec 2027. It is an input to the ICT risk management framework review report (DORA Art. 6(5); RTS (EU) 2024/1774 Art. 27).\n\nTier 1: on the 35 test(s) performed, the controls tested are effective except for NFR-04 (Access management \u0026 recertification), concluded not effective under the deviation rule.\n\nTier 2: on the 21 test(s) performed, the controls tested are effective. NFR-11 (Network security \u0026 exposure) had one deviation, and its sample was extended.\n\nTesting is incomplete: 56 of 64 planned tests were performed and 54 signed off by QA. The conclusion is limited to the tests performed.",
